OL,3,GNEWSACall to improve phone coverage to
OL,4,Ahelp farmer safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farming leader in the Peak District
OL,7,Fhas said poor mobile signal in the area
OL,8,Fis making his industry more dangerous.
OL,10,FNew data from technology company Ookla
OL,11,Fhas ranked the High Peak as the worst
OL,12,Farea in Britain for getting a mobile
OL,13,Fphone signal.
OL,15,FAndrew Critchlow, a National Farmers
OL,16,FUnion (NFU) county adviser, said:
OL,17,F"There are 'not spots' (where there is
OL,18,Fno signal) for any kind of phone
OL,19,Fcompany and that's pretty dangerous
OL,20,Fthen for farmers because you have got a
OL,21,Flot of lone working."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
