OL,3,GNEWSACall to improve phone coverage to
OL,4,Ahelp farmer safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh Peak borough councillor Joanna
OL,7,FCollins said service could be "patchy"
OL,8,For "erratic", but "it's not like we are
OL,9,Fso remote we cannot get any mobile
OL,10,Fphone signal at all".
